%% PakVoice AI — Sequence: Generate Content + RAG
sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant UI as Next.js Generate Page
  participant API as FastAPI /api/generate
  participant AI as AIService
  participant RAG as RAGService
  participant Emb as EmbeddingService
  participant Chroma as ChromaDB
  participant OpenAI as OpenAI API
  participant Hist as JSON History

  Client->>UI: Fill form + optional KB docs
  UI->>API: POST /api/generate/content/stream + JWT
  API->>AI: generate_content_stream(request, user_id)

  alt use_knowledge_base = true and KB not empty
    AI->>RAG: search(query, doc_ids)
    RAG->>Emb: embed_query(query)
    Emb->>OpenAI: Embedding request
    OpenAI-->>Emb: query vector
    Emb-->>RAG: embedding
    RAG->>Chroma: similarity search top-k
    Chroma-->>RAG: chunks + metadata
    RAG-->>AI: context chunks
  else KB disabled or empty
    AI->>AI: Skip RAG
  end

  AI->>AI: build_generation_prompt(+ context)
  AI->>OpenAI: Chat completion stream
  OpenAI-->>AI: token chunks
  AI-->>API: stream text
  API-->>UI: SSE / text stream
  UI-->>Client: Show content live

  AI->>Hist: save_generation_history(...)
  Hist-->>AI: saved
